  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Optimising forest benefits whilst minimising impacts of emerging zoonotic diseases: co-developing an interdisciplinary tool for forests in India</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GCRF Foundation Infections 2016 to reduce health, welfare and livelihood impacts of zoonotic diseases on people that depend on forest ecosystems in LMICs by co-developing an interdisciplinary tool for forests in India</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
